  "body": "Welcome to FORM. A refined collection of six 3 bedroom, architecturally designed standalone homes set in one of Auckland’s most sought-after eastern suburbs, Glendowie.\r\n\r\nDesigned with a focus on contemporary architecture, quality materials and effortless living, each home features open-plan living and dining flowing through to a private, fully landscaped outdoor space. \r\n\r\nConstruction is commencing now, October 2026 with completion scheduled for June 2027. \r\n\r\nSt Heliers Village and beach are just three minutes away, Kohimarama and Kohi Beach Café are five minutes away, while Glendowie College, Sacred Heart College and Churchill Park Primary are all within very close proximity.\r\n\r\nA premium position. A brand-new standalone 3 bedroom home. Your own freehold title.\r\n\r\nLot 1: Under Contract\r\nLot 2: $1,209,000\r\nLot 3: $1,209,000\r\nLot 4: SOLD\r\nLot 5: $1,299,000 (includes 2 car parks)\r\nLot 6: SOLD\r\n\r\nPlease call or use our website to arrange a private meeting in our St Heliers office to discuss customisation options and material samples.\r\n\r\nOur office is located at Suite 201, 387 Tamaki Drive, St Heliers and is open daily for meetings by appointment.\r\n\r\nwww.formglendowie.co.nz",
